{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人李澤銘於節目中推介騰訊(700)，一來集團AI布局更為積極，此外憧憬公司可以複製Meta旗下Muse的成功之路，相信資金改為追逐AI助理的用戶入口潛力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026H26iOh6zuq1790319498.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">李澤銘建議讓股價稍微回調至430元才買入，目標價上望500元，若失守410元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026XOn1QXrvHd1790319525.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">騰訊(700)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$430</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$500</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$410</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人張智威推介南方兩倍做多黃金(7299)，主要是金價和油價近月呈相反走勢，他預料油價會從高位回落，意味金價已有一定調整，因此看好金價反彈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026IVoAGi21Uw1790319557.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">張智威建議22.78元便可買入，目標價看23.5元，止蝕價定於20元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026J0Fy1Sp2nZ1790319587.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南方兩倍做多黃金(7299)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$22.78</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$23.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$20</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T07:38:37.265702+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}